{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is visible, move to it, then take it. If not, scan area. In order to complete more tasks.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = isObjectSpecial    /> <SubTree ID = SpecialTask    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    />\"",
